  guideTitle: "How to Style a Coffee Table So You Can Still Use It",
  metaTitle: "How to Style a Coffee Table Practically",
  metaDescription: "Group a coffee table with a tray, mixed heights and a clear zone for cups: a practical styling method that works with kids, pets and daily use.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/styletable-yellow-sofa-cups-flowerpot.webp",
